KEY ELEMENTS OF THE INTERVENTION
- Collaboration between election authorities, government
entities, and civil society;
- Collaboration between civil society with different but related
areas of focus and expertise;
- Involvement of religious and community leaders;
- Public service announcements and targeted local voter
education efforts including digital literacy;
Fact-checking and countering misinformation and
disinformation.
